{"id":"c6d862e552135487","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-stationary-subset.md","title":"ZFC Stationary Subset","display":"df-zfc-stationary-subset — ZFC Stationary Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-stationary-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-stationary-subset","58-df-zfc-ord-stationary-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-stationary-subset — ZFC Stationary Subset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-club-subset]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-stationary-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-stationary-subset</span><span>58-df-zfc-ord-stationary-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-stationary-subset — ZFC Stationary Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3343ee70542e7296\" href=\"?note=3343ee70542e7296\" title=\"58-df-zfc-club-subset\">58-df-zfc-club-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(S,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3343ee70542e7296\" href=\"?note=3343ee70542e7296\" title=\"58-df-zfc-club-subset\">58-df-zfc-club-subset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StationarySubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrdStationarySubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{StationarySubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrdStationarySubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{StationarySubset}_S(S,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa \\land \\forall C\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(C,\\kappa)\\to S\\cap C\\neq\\emptyset)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{StationarySubset}_S(S,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa \\land \\forall C\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(C,\\kappa)\\to S\\cap C\\neq\\emptyset)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdStationarySubset}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{StationarySubset}_S(S,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdStationarySubset}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{StationarySubset}_S(S,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The explicit clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\in\\kappa\">\\(\\omega\\in\\kappa\\)</span> gives the standard regular uncountable ambient cardinal.  Without it, the club implication is vacuous at finite regular cardinals because the upstream club predicate requires a limit ordinal.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-ord-stationary-subset</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-club-subset","status":"resolved","id":"3343ee70542e7296","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-club-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-regular-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-club-subset","status":"resolved","id":"3343ee70542e7296","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-club-subset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StationarySubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrdStationarySubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{StationarySubset}_S(S,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa \\land \\forall C\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ClubSubset}_S(C,\\kappa)\\to S\\cap C\\neq\\emptyset)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdStationarySubset}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{StationarySubset}_S(S,\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega\\in\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1422,"backlinks":[{"id":"d9fa9d2c5cd5c7f2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StationarySubset}_S$ (stationary-subset predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-stationary-subset.md]])"},{"id":"ec7b15e6613808fd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrdStationarySubset}_S$ (stationary-subset alias predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-stationary-subset.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3496","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-stationary-subset.md|58-df-zfc-stationary-subset]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","3343ee70542e7296","0fbfc19800246e77"]}